flowchart TB
  US[Konnect US management plane]
  Private[Internal authorized clients] --> PrivateEdge[Private ingress / no public route]
  Public[External authorized clients] --> PublicEdge[Public edge + WAF / DDoS / request controls]
  subgraph AWS[AWS account boundaries]
    AI[AWS internal gateway targets]
    AE[AWS external gateway targets]
  end
  subgraph Azure[Azure subscription boundaries]
    ZI[Azure internal gateway targets]
    ZE[Azure external gateway targets]
  end
  subgraph GCP[GCP project boundaries]
    GI[GCP internal gateway targets]
    GE[GCP external gateway targets]
  end
  PrivateEdge --> AI & ZI & GI
  PublicEdge --> AE & ZE & GE
  US -. configuration .-> AI & AE & ZI & ZE & GI & GE
  AI & AE & ZI & ZE & GI & GE --> Egress[Approved egress + TLS + upstream identity]
  Egress --> Services[LLM providers / MCP servers / A2A agents]
  Separate[Each group has separate dev / test / preprod / prod gateways, secrets and ephemeral runner groups]
